{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A brilliant scientist has created the impossible \u2014 <strong>a machine that can travel through time.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together with his grandson, he begins a mission to change history itself. Their goal is simple: go back to the past, correct humanity's greatest mistakes, and create <strong>\u201cUltimate Peace\u201d.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wars could be prevented.<br>Natural Disasters could be stopped.<br>Entire timelines could be rewritten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But <strong>you are that grandson.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the deeper you travel, the more you begin to wonder \u2014 <strong>whose peace is your grandfather actually fighting for?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each change begins to destabilize the timeline, creating new dangers, strange anomalies, and powerful enemies that should not exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the mission continues, a darker question slowly surfaces:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Does the scientist truly want peace\u2026</strong><br><strong>Or is he hiding a far more dangerous agenda?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Some secrets in history were never meant to be uncovered.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use powerful <strong>time-manipulation abilities</strong> to fight enemies, solve puzzles, and survive deadly encounters across different eras \u2014 as the timeline slowly begins to collapse around you.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564520/extras/9f9da6bec1c92f6ade3e7696cc2c6a08.poster.avif?t=1773715711\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564520/extras/9f9da6bec1c92f6ade3e7696cc2c6a08.webm?t=1773715711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564520/extras/9f9da6bec1c92f6ade3e7696cc2c6a08.mp4?t=1773715711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d BATTLE ACROSS DIFFERENT ERAS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >History is not just something you study \u2014 <strong>it's something you fight through.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across humanity's most defining and dangerous moments, where every era introduces new enemies, environments, and unexpected threats.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infiltrate <strong>secret Army facilities during World War</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face deadly warriors in <strong>ancient civilizations</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive chaotic battlefields, global disasters, and fractured futures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden events and secrets buried deep within the timeline</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each era brings new dangers\u2026 and new questions about <strong>who is truly shaping history.</strong><br> <br>   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564520/extras/9c111afb425dab6fbdcd3c0c2b3ffda9.poster.avif?t=1773715711\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564520/extras/9c111afb425dab6fbdcd3c0c2b3ffda9.webm?t=1773715711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564520/extras/9c111afb425dab6fbdcd3c0c2b3ffda9.mp4?t=1773715711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u23f3 MASTER TIME POWERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control time itself to survive impossible situations.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freeze time mid-combat</strong> \u2014 stop bullets and enemies in their tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deploy time shields</strong> to absorb devastating attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rewind mistakes</strong> before they cost you everything</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slow the world</strong> and navigate situations no ordinary soldier could survive</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master time itself \u2014 <strong>or be destroyed by it.</strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564520/extras/090cb5fac4f8aea2fdb94d31c50be408.poster.avif?t=1773715711\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564520/extras/090cb5fac4f8aea2fdb94d31c50be408.webm?t=1773715711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564520/extras/090cb5fac4f8aea2fdb94d31c50be408.mp4?t=1773715711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2694\ufe0f DYNAMIC COMBAT ENCOUNTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every era brings enemies that fight by their own rules.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle soldiers, machines, assassins, and enemies that shouldn't even exist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge bullets, traps, and deadly weapons created across different timelines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine <strong>movement, combat, and time powers</strong> to outmaneuver powerful foes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast reflexes alone won't save you \u2014 <strong>you must learn to fight with time itself.</strong><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564520/extras/42bdb7002540a63f554272dd97ed7b57.poster.avif?t=1773715711\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564520/extras/42bdb7002540a63f554272dd97ed7b57.webm?t=1773715711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564520/extras/42bdb7002540a63f554272dd97ed7b57.mp4?t=1773715711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 SMART GAMEPLAY CHALLENGES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every obstacle can be defeated with brute force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the timeline you will face situations that require <strong>creative use of your abilities</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate objects and events across different moments in time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your powers to bypass traps, security systems, and environmental hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with time mechanics to overcome unusual situations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes the key to moving forward is not fighting harder\u2026 <strong>but thinking differently.</strong><br>      <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564520/extras/aa68268a7aaef781de850ba48c9f563a.poster.avif?t=1773715711\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564520/extras/aa68268a7aaef781de850ba48c9f563a.webm?t=1773715711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564520/extras/aa68268a7aaef781de850ba48c9f563a.mp4?t=1773715711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Change the past.</strong> <br><strong>Protect the present. </strong>   <br><strong>Save the future.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/image