n history were never meant to be uncovered.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use powerful <strong>time-manipulation abilities</strong> to fight enemies, solve puzzles, and survive deadly encounters across different eras \u2014 as the timeline slowly begins to collapse around you.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564520/extras/9f9da6bec1c92f6ade3e7696cc2c6a08.poster.avif?t=1773715711\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564520/extras/9f9da6bec1c92f6ade3e7696cc2c6a08.webm?t=1773715711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564520/extras/9f9da6bec1c92f6ade3e7696cc2c6a08.mp4?t=1773715711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d BATTLE ACROSS DIFFERENT ERAS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >History is not just something you study \u2014 <strong>it's something you fight through.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across humanity's most defining and dangerous moments, where every era introduces new enemies, environments, and unexpected threats.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infiltrate <strong>secret Army facilities during World War</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face deadly warriors in <strong>ancient civilizations</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive chaotic battlefields, global disasters, and fractured futures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden events and secrets buried deep within the timeline</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each era brings new dangers\u2026 and new questions about <strong>who is truly shaping history.</strong><br> <br>   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.s